70
00:03:24,867 --> 00:03:28,621
Or more specifically, for short-term engagement and satisfaction.

71
00:03:28,621 --> 00:03:29,830
Did you click the link,

72
00:03:29,830 --> 00:03:31,666
watch the video, like the song?

73
00:03:31,666 --> 00:03:34,418
If yes, AI gets a clap on the shoulder.

